---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BarberList from '../components/BarberList.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Our Barbers | Sixpenny Barber Shop, Denver"
  description="Meet the three barbers at Sixpenny Barber Shop in Capitol Hill, Denver, open since 2011."
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>Three chairs, three barbers</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Theo Vance opened Sixpenny in 2011 in an old shoe repair shop on Brasswick Street. The
      chairs came from a shop in Pueblo that closed after sixty years.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="wrap">
      <BarberList />
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="tiles" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <h2>Why it's called Sixpenny</h2>
      <div>
        <p class="lede">
          Theo's grandfather cut hair in Manchester, England, and charged sixpence for a short back
          and sides. The coin he kept from his first day sits in a frame by the register.
        </p>
        <p>
          The shop works the way his did. You get the same barber if you want one, a real
          conversation if you want one, and quiet if you don't. Nobody tries to sell you a bottle
          of anything.
        </p>
        <p>
          The game is usually on, the coffee is free, and there's a stack of comics for kids who
          need distracting.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
